# BuildKit reads this file (not a root .dockerignore) for
# containers/Dockerfile.sgt-train because it sits next to the Dockerfile and is
# named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore. The build context is the repository root, so
# the file is an allowlist: everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. GMD_SGT sources arrive through a named context (build.sh).
*
!containers/scripts/validate_platform.py
!containers/scripts/validate_sgt_stack.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
